# What a search of the project skips (ripgrep, and the editors and AI
# assistants that search with it). Not git: all of this is tracked.
#
# These are large, and match a search for any piece of the app's text
# without being the code that puts it there. To search one on purpose, name
# it: rg --no-ignore "Make short" app/core/translations

# Every string in eight languages (tools/i18n/ works on these).
/app/core/translations/

# Generated or bulk data.
/buddy.zip
/app/pages/text_animator/motion_presets.json
/docs/daw-mockups.html
